---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Alessandro Campos"
  description="Learn more about Alessandro, a Systems Engineering student graduating in November 2026, focused on web development, databases and practical software solutions."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <Header />

    <main class="flex-1">
      <section class="hero-shell border-b border-white/10">
        <div class="container-custom grid gap-10 py-20 md:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.72fr] lg:items-center">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-5 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-300">About / Sobre mi</p>
            <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-5xl">
              I build practical systems where interface, backend logic and data work together.
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-9 text-slate-300">
              I'm a Systems Engineering student at Universidad Tecnologica Costarricense (UTC),
              graduating in November 2026. My focus is web development, databases and tools that
              solve real operational problems.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-400">
              Me interesa crear software claro, mantenible y util para negocios: sistemas administrativos,
              inventarios, dashboards, reportes y flujos conectados a bases de datos.
            </p>
          </div>

          <aside class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-black/30">
            <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Developer Profile</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Current focus</p>
              </div>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-emerald-300">
                Available
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="stat-tile">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">Main stack</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">SQL, PHP, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Astro, Tailwind CSS</p>
              </div>
              <div class="stat-tile">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">Looking for</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">Internships, junior roles and real development projects.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="stat-tile">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">Languages</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">Spanish native, English B2.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container-custom py-16 md:py-24">
        <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.78fr_1.22fr]">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-300">How I work</p>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl">Technical thinking with practical outcomes</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
            <article class="info-panel">
              <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">Analyze</p>
              <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">I start by understanding the workflow, data and user needs before building screens.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="info-panel">
              <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">Structure</p>
              <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">I organize modules, database tables and UI sections so the system can grow.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="info-panel">
              <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">Build</p>
              <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">I implement CRUD flows, validations, dashboards, reports and responsive interfaces.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="info-panel">
              <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">Improve</p>
              <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">I review usability, code organization and opportunities to make the product clearer.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-band border-y border-white/10 py-16 md:py-24">
        <div class="container-custom grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-6 lg:col-span-2">
            <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-300">Education</p>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Bachelor's in Systems Engineering</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400">Universidad Tecnologica Costarricense (UTC)</p>
            <span class="mt-5 inline-flex rounded-full border border-emerald-400/30 bg-emerald-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-300">
              Graduating November 2026
            </span>
            <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
              Academic work focused on software development, databases, systems analysis, networking
              and software engineering principles, with an emphasis on practical implementation.
            </p>
          </article>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-6">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">Cybersecurity</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">Learning secure development practices, threat awareness and vulnerability concepts.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-6">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200">English B2</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">Comfortable reading documentation and communicating in professional environments.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container-custom py-16 md:py-24">
        <div class="grid gap-8 rounded-xl border border-cyan-300/20 bg-cyan-300/10 p-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-center md:p-10">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-200">Next step</p>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Ready to contribute to real projects</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
              I want to join a team where I can keep learning, build useful systems and improve through feedback.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 md:justify-end">
            <a href="/projects" class="rounded-lg bg-cyan-300 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-cyan-200">
              See Projects
            </a>
            <a href="/contact" class="rounded-lg border border-white/20 px-6 py-3 text-white transition hover:border-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-300">
              Contact Me
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
